      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_02",
      "hash64": "91242FF43F80CD6C",
      "text": "Bienvenue dans mon école, l’Institut Myrtille ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_03",
      "hash64": "912430F43F80CF1F",
      "text": "Ce que tu vois ici n’est que l’entrée.\\nLe reste se trouve sous nos pieds !\\c\\nEh oui, mon institut a été construit sous la mer !\\nÉpatant, non ?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_04",
      "hash64": "91242DF43F80CA06",
      "text": "Quoi d’autre... ? Quoi d’autre... ?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "91242EF43F80CBB9",
      "text": "Ah, oui ! Admire tout ce bleu !\\nC’est ma couleur préférée, celle de la myrtille ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "91242BF43F80C6A0",
      "text": "Quoi d’autre... ? Voyons...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "91242CF43F80C853",
      "text": "Hmmm... Et si c’était plutôt toi qui me demandais\\nce que tu veux savoir ?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_select_01",
      "hash64": "65A9E70EAD5FA5C7",
      "text": "Pourquoi l’institut est-il sous-marin ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_select_02",
      "hash64": "65A9E80EAD5FA77A",
      "text": "Pourquoi s’appelle-t-il « Myrtille » ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_select_03",
      "hash64": "65A9E90EAD5FA92D",
      "text": "D’où connaissez-vous monsieur Clavel ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_08",
      "hash64": "912439F43F80DE6A",
      "text": "En voilà une question bizarre ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_09",
      "hash64": "91243AF43F80E01D",
      "text": "Voyons, laisse-moi réfléchir... Euh...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "EE9DFBF44274CAB6",
      "text": "C’est parce qu’il est rattaché à un centre qui\\nexploite les ressources sous-marines.\\c\\nEn tout cas, c’est ce qu’on m’a dit ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "EE9DFAF44274C903",
      "text": "C’est parce que dans certaines cultures, la myrtille\\nsymbolise la recherche de nouvelles expériences.\\c\\nEt c’est justement l’une des valeurs de notre\\ninstitut...\\r\\nEn tout cas, c’est ce que j’ai compris ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 206,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "EE9DF9F44274C750",
      "text": "Monsieur Cyano et monsieur Clavel ont étudié\\nà la même université...\\r\\nEn tout cas, c’est ce que j’ai entendu ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_10",
      "hash64": "9127B7F43F83EA5B",
      "text": "C’est exactement ça !\\nJe m’apprêtais à le dire.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "9127B6F43F83E8A8",
      "text": "Merci Taro, tu m’as littéralement ôté les mots\\nde la bouche ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "EE9E00F44274D335",
      "text": "Mais je vous en prie ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "EE9DFFF44274D182",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, qui avons-nous là ?\\nEst-ce un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e invité[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_12",
      "hash64": "9127B9F43F83EDC1",
      "text": "Oui ! Je te présente [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0402)]IlElle est ici dans le cadre d’un échange scolaire !\\r\\nJ’espère que vous vous entendrez bien ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0402"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "EE9DFEF44274CFCF",
      "text": "Mais... ! Ne serait-ce pas l’élève de Paldea dont\\ntout le monde parle ?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "EE9DFDF44274CE1C",
      "text": "Oh, je ne me suis pas encore présentée !\\nJe m’appelle Taro et je suis en deuxième année ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "EE9E04F44274DA01",
      "text": "Tu dois être une personne exceptionnelle, pour\\nque monsieur Cyano se souvienne de ton nom !\\r\\nD’habitude, c’est limite s’il n’oublie pas le sien ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_13",
      "hash64": "9127B8F43F83EC0E",
      "text": "Toujours le mot pour rire, ma petite Taro.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_14",
      "hash64": "9127BBF43F83F127",
      "text": "Mais j’y pense ! Pourquoi ne m’aiderais-tu pas\\nà faire découvrir les merveilles de mon institut\\r\\nà notre invité[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "EE9E03F44274D84E",
      "text": "Hein ? Moi ?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "9127BAF43F83EF74",
      "text": "Mais oui ! Cela sera plus divertissant,\\nsi tu nous accompagnes ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "EE9A76F44271B2E0",
      "text": "Certes, mais n’y a-t-il personne de plus indiqué\\npour cette tâche... ?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_11",
      "hash64": "EE9A77F44271B493",
      "text": "Euh, je précise que je ne dis pas ça par manque\\nd’envie de t’accompagner ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_12",
      "hash64": "EE9A78F44271B646",
      "text": "C’est juste que monsieur Cyano a une fâcheuse\\ntendance à se dédouaner des tâches qui lui\\r\\nincombent...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_13",
      "hash64": "EE9A79F44271B7F9",
      "text": "Et ça, je n’approuve pas du tout ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_16",
      "hash64": "9127BDF43F83F48D",
      "text": "Oh, tu es toujours si sévère avec ton pauvre\\ndirecteur...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_14",
      "hash64": "EE9A7AF44271B9AC",
      "text": "Ceci étant dit... ça serait l’occasion de discuter\\navec l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]ea fameu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]xse [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Hmmm...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 3,
